# leak-scan allowlist — one extended regex per line; a scan hit whose full
# "path:line:text" matches any of these is ignored. Add an entry ONLY for a value that
# is deliberately public and documented. Keep a comment above each entry saying why.

# The public KubeMQ images that `kmq deploy prepare` pins (documented in docs/).
europe-docker\.pkg\.dev/kubemq/public/
europe-docker\.pkg\.dev/kubemq/images/kmq

# RFC 5737 documentation address ranges used in examples (never real operator IPs).
\b203\.0\.113\.[0-9]{1,3}/32\b
\b198\.51\.100\.[0-9]{1,3}/32\b
\b192\.0\.2\.[0-9]{1,3}/32\b

# Public contact / bot addresses that are supposed to be in a public repo.
@kubemq\.io\b
@users\.noreply\.github\.com\b
noreply@github\.com\b
